#AI:1
TYPE="stack_meta"
STACK="go"
DISPLAY_NAME="Go"

DESCRIPTION:
Go services, CLIs, and libraries. Idiomatic Go — no frameworks unless
explicitly chosen (Gin, Echo, Chi for HTTP; cobra for CLI).

RECOMMENDED_TOOLS:
- Runtime:       Go 1.22+
- Dependency:    go modules (go.mod)
- Linter:        golangci-lint
- Format:        gofmt / goimports (enforced by golangci-lint)
- Test:          go test ./...
- Mocking:       testify/mock or gomock

INIT_NOTES:
- init-project.sh copies code.ai → .claude/rules/code.ai
- init-project.sh copies tests.ai → .claude/rules/tests.ai
- Pin Go version in go.mod and .go-version
